Package: manifoldstats
Type: Package
Title: Generic Statistics on Matrix Manifolds
Version: 0.1.0
Description: A common interface (geodesic distance, exponential/logarithm
    maps, Frechet mean, parallel transport) for statistics on the
    Bures-Wasserstein manifold of SPD matrices, the Grassmannian, and the
    sphere, plus a Riemannian factor model for Bures-Wasserstein data.
